"fee": "0.6207605257392", "filled_at_ms": 1789894319999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789883999999, "market_context": {"regime": "H4 bull-trend (channel) with an unconfirmed reversal candidate; M15/H1 in a tight 12-bar range at the low of a strong bear breakout", "h4_context": "current, as-of 1789876799999: primary_regime bull-trend, phase channel, always_in long (medium relevance); bars 111-112 broke out with closes near highs (2578.60 of 2585.50; 2636.28 of 2643.52) and held above 2604.75 for eight bars to 2700.00 (bar 116 high); its newest content is the H1 bar 117 close 2586.68 - used as location context, not as a vote", "h1_raw": "bar 116 (open_time 1789869600000) open 2617.83, low 2571, close 2573.13 broke the range low 2604.75; bar 117 bull reversal close 2586.68; bars 118-119 close 2580.35 and 2577.06, the last close below bar 118's low 2578.33", "m15_raw": "120 closed bars; bear spike bar 107 (open 2603.75, low 2571, close 2573.13), then a 12-bar tight range 2569.8-2594.57 (bars 108-119) with falling highs and a held double bottom at 2570.27/2569.8", "location": "2577.06 is in the lower third of the M15 range, at/above the prior H1 base (bar 81 low 2569.16, high 2585.5) and above the H4 pre-breakout top 2544.63, so the higher-timeframe breakout structure is not broken", "opposing_case": "a large H1/H4 bear bar closed below the 7-bar H4 tight range low 2604.75; the 12-bar M15 range can be a bear flag and the first reversal after such a spike often fails"}, "setup": {"type": "breakout_pullback", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "favorable", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["M15", "H1", "H4"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (bull reversal bar at the range low)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2577.99", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1789883100000, "close_time_ms": 1789883999999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 109 low - pullback double-bottom low", "price_field": "low", "price": "2569.8", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 109, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}}, "evidence_for": ["Broader structure is a bull trend on H4 (current context): bars 111-112 closed near their highs (2578.60 of a 2585.50 high; 2636.28 of a 2643.52 high) and the break above 2537.57/2544.63/2609.02 held above 2604.75 for eight bars to 2700.00 (bar 116 high); the last raw close 2577.06 is still above the H4 pre-breakout top 2544.63 (context, not a vote).", "The M15 pullback came back to the prior H1 breakout base and held: M15 bar 109 (open_time 1789874100000) low 2569.8 versus H1 bar 81 (open_time 1789743600000) low 2569.16 and high 2585.5; H1 bar 117 (open_time 1789873200000) open 2572.94, low 2569.8, close 2586.68 - a bull reversal bar closing back above 2585.5.", "After the M15 bear spike bar 107 (open 2603.75, low 2571, close 2573.13) there is no new low: bars 108 and 109 set 2570.27 and 2569.8, and the last three lows are 2574.41 (bar 117), 2573.82 (bar 118), 2574.18 (bar 119) with no close below 2573.13 - a double bottom that keeps holding.", "M15 bar 119 (open_time 1789883100000) open 2574.40, high 2577.99, low 2574.18, close 2577.06 is a bull reversal bar closing near its high that reverses bar 118's bear bar (open 2577.21, low 2573.82, close 2574.40) at the low of the 12-bar range 2569.8-2594.57.", "Location and equation: the pending stop sits in the lower third of a 24.77-point tight range, 8.19 above the structural low 2569.8, while the first resistance at 2594.57 (bars 108/109 high) is 16.58 away."], "evidence_against": ["Strongest counter: the large recent bars are bear breakouts that broke structure - M15 bar 107 (open 26