er-timeframe breakout structure is not broken", "opposing_case": "a large H1/H4 bear bar closed below the 7-bar H4 tight range low 2604.75; the 12-bar M15 range can be a bear flag and the first reversal after such a spike often fails"}, "setup": {"type": "breakout_pullback", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "favorable", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["M15", "H1", "H4"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (bull reversal bar at the range low)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2577.99", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1789883100000, "close_time_ms": 1789883999999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 109 low - pullback double-bottom low", "price_field": "low", "price": "2569.8", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 109, "open_time_ms": 1789874100000, "close_time_ms": 1789874999999}}, "evidence_for": ["Broader structure is a bull trend on H4 (current context): bars 111-112 closed near their highs (2578.60 of a 2585.50 high; 2636.28 of a 2643.52 high) and the break above 2537.57/2544.63/2609.02 held above 2604.75 for eight bars to 2700.00 (bar 116 high); the last raw close 2577.06 is still above the H4 pre-breakout top 2544.63 (context, not a vote).", "The M15 pullback came back to the prior H1 breakout base and held: M15 bar 109 (open_time 1789874100000) low 2569.8 versus H1 bar 81 (open_time 1789743600000) low 2569.16 and high 2585.5; H1 bar 117 (open_time 1789873200000) open 2572.94, low 2569.8, close 2586.68 - a bull reversal bar closing back above 2585.5.", "After the M15 bear spike bar 107 (open 2603.75, low 2571, close 2573.13) there is no new low: bars 108 and 109 set 2570.27 and 2569.8, and the last three lows are 2574.41 (bar 117), 2573.82 (bar 118), 2574.18 (bar 119) with no close below 2573.13 - a double bottom that keeps holding.", "M