nd a break above 2594.57 (bull flag) are both live.", "The buy stop at 2577.99 is pending and untriggered at the 2577.06 close; if price closes below 2569.8 first the setup is void.", "The H4 context's content ends at the H1 bar 117 close 2586.68 (as-of 1789876799999) and excludes H1 bars 118-119 (closes 2580.35, 2577.06), so its bullish 'final close above 2585.50' point is older than the raw bars.", "The 2700.00 buy climax with a 61.51 upper tail raises the chance the pullback extends toward 2537.57-2544.63 before any resumption, which would invalidate this entry even if the larger trend stays up."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["An M15 close below 2569.8 (bar 109 low) breaks the pullback's double bottom and voids the long; next references are the H4 pre-breakout top 2544.63/2537.57 and then 2495.82.", "Acceptance above 2594.57 (bars 108/109 high) confirms the range as a bull flag and puts 2604.75 and 2643.52 in play.", "Two consecutive M15 closes below 2569.8 would confirm the bear flag and shift the read toward the H4 range breakdown described in the H4 transition conditions.", "If price makes a lower high under 2577.99 and closes below 2573.82 (bar 118 low) without triggering, the bull signal is stale and the 12-bar range reads as a bear flag."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 22